You are right, I had counted the 400 as covering the whole gap. It doesn't.

What we can do: about 60 pallets per day of our volume are domestic shipments=
 that can go on one-way pallets, and we have those in stock. If I switch thos=
e from tomorrow, EUR pallet use drops to roughly 60 per day and the 684 shoul=
d just last until the 30 Oct delivery. Very tight, but it works on paper.

I am asking Sofie for the 400 now. After this I want the safety stock raised =
so we never end up here again.

Thanks,
